00:25:15.580 --> 00:25:17.180
I can select this.

00:25:17.180 --> 00:25:18.990
Go all through this.

00:25:18.990 --> 00:25:20.950
Select the database
you want to export.

00:25:20.950 --> 00:25:23.050
Select the region.

00:25:23.050 --> 00:25:25.640
You want to select the region
where that instance is actually

00:25:25.640 --> 00:25:26.140
living.

00:25:26.140 --> 00:25:28.900
And it shows you which
one is recommended.

00:25:28.900 --> 00:25:32.200
Confirm all the changes,
and then you do the export.

00:25:32.200 --> 00:25:34.810
For this example, for
this database that

00:25:34.810 --> 00:25:37.710
has around 120
gigabytes of data,

